        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>1-1/4 Inch Mortise Lock Cylinder with Yale, Satin Chrome</b>\r\n<p>\r\n1-1/4\" length mortise cylinder with \"Standard Yale\" style cam.  Used on panic device for dogging and alarm control. For use with  <a href=\"/products/surface-mount-door-alarm-set-detex-eax-500mc65\"><b>DETEX EAX-500 Door Alarm</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/alarm-rim-device-detex-v40eb62836\"><b>DETEX V40EB62836 Alarm Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/surface-mount-door-alarm-alarm-lock-pg21\"><b>Alarm Lock PG21 Door Alarm</b></a>, Monarch and Von Duprin panic devices. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available with Adams Rite A/R Cam  <a href=\"/products/1-1-4-inch-mortise-cylinder-lock\"><b>DL-CYLTA580CSKD-US26D</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for DL-CYLTA580CSDCAM-US26D 1-1/4\" Mortise Lock Cylinder\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyed Mortise Cylinder (threaded to screw into mortise lock body)</li>\r\n<li>Key Cylinder 6-pin Schlage \"C\" Keyway</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder Length: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Cylinder Diameter: Standard 1-5/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Cam: Standard Yale Style</li>\r\n<li>Includes 3/16\" Stamped Trim Ring</a></li>\r\n<li>Includes 2 Keys</li>\r\n<li> Solid Brass Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Chrome</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
